WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.641
The red planet.

00:02.341 --> 00:07.955
Mars is half as wide as the Earth, and its day is forty minutes longer than ours.

00:08.405 --> 00:13.637
The red is rust: iron in the dust, which the wind spreads over the whole planet.

00:14.087 --> 00:19.394
Machines have been landing here for fifty years, and two rovers are still driving.
